  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the institutional capacities of the association to ensure its readiness and ability to deliver sustainable services for women and children.Supporting essential operational costs to ensure the continuity of the association&#x2019;s work and its centers in serving the most affected groups.Providing a direct response to the needs of women and children through the implementation of recreational and stress-relief activities in high-violence areas.Supporting and rehabilitating small local women-led initiatives in affected areas to enhance their ability to continue delivering community services and to build the association&#x2019;s presence within these communities</narrative>
  </description>
