  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mission:
Empowerment of women in Tulkarm, and enhance their role in decision-making positions under the laws which ensure their protection in an equal democratic civil society.


Goals:
1 - Contribute to the reduction of violence against women in Tulkarm.
2 - Raising the level of efficiency of women educationally and professionally towards a high level and rank.
3 - Raising the level of participation of women and enhance their role in decision-making positions.
4 - Building and developing the capacity of the crew and the continuity of the institution.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Women Development Socie</narrative>
